This repository contains training code whose structure is adapted from the
tinker-cookbook project by Thinking Machines Lab
(https://github.com/thinking-machines-lab/tinker-cookbook, baseline commit 00c8589),
in particular tinker_cookbook/recipes/rl_loop.py (e.g. the chz Config and GRPO
training loop in src/co_scientist/rubric_reward/grpo/best_ver.py and trainers
derived from it). The code also imports tinker_cookbook as a library dependency.

tinker-cookbook is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy is
provided in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES/tinker-cookbook-LICENSE.

The research task and rubric-reward method follow "Training AI Co-Scientists
Using Rubric Rewards" (Goel et al., arXiv:2512.23707). The dataset
facebook/research-plan-gen is not redistributed here.
